description:
(Amended 11/24/2026) 

U.S. Fish &amp; Wildlife Service (FWS) requires the simple removal of the existing ceiling mounted divider doors located inside the agency&#39;s conference room due to fire code violation by the fire marshal. The project is at a leased location and permission has been granted by the Lessor (Collier) for GSA to perform the work. Refer to the project&#39;s statement of work (attachment) for full details and requirements. 



Building Name and Address:&nbsp; 

Tudor Business Center / 1011 E. Tudor Rd. / Anchorage, AK 99503) 



To schedule a site visit please contact Michael Luu via email at&nbsp; &lt;michael.luu@gsa.gov&gt;.&nbsp; Please note that an employee of the FWS will perform the actual on-site tour.&nbsp; 



Submission of Offers: There is not Standard Form (EG: SF1449 or SF1442) required for this project.&nbsp; Please provide your offer/ quotes via your company&#39;s standard proposal or estimate forms.&nbsp; Offers must include any and all subcontractor quotes if applicable along with a full detailed breakdown of costs. Offers should be emailed to Brian Teague at brian.teague@gsa.gov by the due date and time listed in this public notice.&nbsp; &nbsp; 



This procurment will use Simplified Acquisition Procedures.&nbsp; This will be a firm-fixed price contract.&nbsp; &nbsp;And the basis of award will be price.&nbsp; The period of performance from the award date will be 30 days.&nbsp; Escorting of contractor personnel will be performed by the FWS, so badged HSPD-12 / security cleared personnel is not required. 

